#: processes/content/j2-chw-discovery-referral.bpmn:11
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "J2, Return home, CHW discovery and referral. Back in Country B (home, XXH), where the family resides, the community health worker finds an infant born abroad who is missing from the household roster on a home visit. Offline, the CHW app adds the infant to the household (a FHIR Group, through a structured data capture form), reads the foreign DVCs without verifying them (read-unverified, STT-VER-011: the triage read stops before the trust lookup and marks every field unverified), saves the doses as reported by the family, not verified (Immunization.primarySource false), and refers the infant to the clinic for verification. Everything is queued on the phone and syncs when it next has a signal. The CHW app is a Receiver (SMART Trust, smart-trust-phw) that deliberately stops before trust; the caregiver provides the VDHC as Holder (smart-trust-phw requirement provide-a-vhl-to-a-receiver)."
msgstr "J2，回国、CHW 发现与转诊。回到家庭居住的 B 国（本国，XXH）后，社区卫生工作者在一次家访中发现一名在境外出生、未列入家庭成员名册的婴儿。在离线状态下，CHW 应用将该婴儿添加到家庭中（一个 FHIR Group，通过结构化数据采集表单），读取境外 DVC 但不验证（read-unverified，STT-VER-011：分诊读取在信任查询之前停止，并将每个字段标记为未验证），将剂次保存为家庭报告、未经验证（Immunization.primarySource 为 false），并将婴儿转诊至诊所进行验证。所有内容都在手机上排队，待下次有信号时同步。CHW 应用是一个接收方（Receiver，SMART Trust、smart-trust-phw），它有意在信任环节之前停止；照护者作为持有人提供 VDHC（smart-trust-phw 需求 provide-a-vhl-to-a-receiver）。"

#: processes/content/j2-chw-discovery-referral.bpmn:32
#. Diagram label
msgid "Read each DVC unverified (triage)"
msgstr "读取每份 DVC，不验证（分诊）"

#: processes/content/j2-chw-discovery-referral.bpmn:32
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "read-unverified (STT-VER-011): strip HC1:, Base45, inflate within limits (STT-B45-002, STT-ZIP-002), bounded CBOR (STT-CBR-003), payloads read but flagged unverified; no trust list needed, fully offline."
msgstr "read-unverified（STT-VER-011）：去除 HC1:，Base45 解码，在限制范围内解压（STT-B45-002、STT-ZIP-002），有界 CBOR（STT-CBR-003），载荷已读取但标记为未验证；无需信任列表，完全离线。"

